 "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_683890534781612_1845730143550472367_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GXBq2u1_94UQ7kNvwHEC2n0&_nc_oc=AdqFUwAJycx6k8oKLbbUjw46vNe8So_i0WxZ82qnNfiI7Q1fyOzQ2Ab2n2CSEIB9agY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzNGkWmsBW1ZvZ2LBfOx2syBcvnPu0ardu0UwoUb5_ERA&oe=69CE80A4"}, {"file_name": "3 SC- upgrade.png", "id": "1089105139847913", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302770_1089105146514579_4248858233085192791_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W_ZgJe6bdw4Q7kNvwE0oLss&_nc_oc=AdqfeKizMr1BJPbVkR6GWSjB3X4TRfyg0GdrPSXaEYILiTLZsQl9yY0IZslyUqc0ews&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afzk1ylyOyu5KencpZpLyEImmvxfN05Ge3haOZ-_NyuUGA&oe=69CE642C"}, {"file_name": "Screen_03_Combat.png", "id": "910125081636304", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307326_910125084969637_8062525329240909942_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MhhvjQ9j9WcQ7kNvwEPsu3q&_nc_oc=Adq37AY4p9bcvcnehQeYOTYdP215hTlWPES6OLlB5nHIjVQU8D4m4dfDDv9IPH6qBHE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwyfkGR8H3RjlYq_5XP9HMnrLT-Y-pT9-25k2xLsTcvxA&oe=69CE631C"}, {"file_name": "Screen_02_Combat.png", "id": "782108887855752", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_782108891189085_1310893654474811832_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1l1KpSRaljkQ7kNvwHT9ecs&_nc_oc=Ado_cbWgQ-dVJVbHNLoG4v4keBe-Eyo7EBDLoRKDvoWZBqgcoWZf5elr9OQ6_gvnnu8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afwd2CvZFFFtaUFvko9uzS6U7QuiSeDXCIIzdExAhBO0OA&oe=69CE569D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Thumbnail.png", "id": "2692830891061149", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_2692830894394482_8747474291273843826_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hJ7jc2Cp1xkQ7kNvwEPHDb0&_nc_oc=AdpamH-u1twTSOhMPt341MaDEW7ydqSfOJTL2nC-1Jk8LNnyKzCoZKE37spAzRRZxVw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afwz7tgY90I4EgXS-JQxRsaYwezv_7qTNUtx_2qnUHLdYA&oe=69CE5BCF"}, "display_name": "Plasmaborne", "keywords": ["Shooter", "roguelike", "Hell", "Demons"], "long_description": "# Fast. Fluid. Ferocious\nDescend into the abyss and tear through handcrafted arenas where speed, precision, and raw power rule. Plasmaborne is a high-intensity single-player VR roguelike shooter built for players who crave momentum, mastery, and chaos.\n{2188548808336788}\n# Become Godlike!\nFall. Rise. Adapt. Collect upgrades, forge new builds, and return stronger than before. Each failure feeds progress, sharpening your instincts and unlocking new ways to fight.\n{747652215014871}\n# Dual-Wield Destruction\nBuild your own loadout, each hand with a powerful weapon and layer on passives that reshape your playstyle. Build your kit in the lobby, then unleash it in the arena. Every run becomes a different kind of chaos.\n{1178417621063675}\nFusing tight gunplay, brutal melee, and searing flamethrower chaos into one relentless VR combat experience.\n{1591134325586122}\n# Handcrafted Arenas. Infinite Replay\nEach battleground pushes fresh tactics and reactions. Learn enemy behaviors, chain stylish dashes, and ride perfect momentum through escalating challenges.\n\n", "short_description": "Plasmaborne is a fast, high-intensity VR roguelike shooter built for players who thrive on speed and precision. Tear through handcrafted arenas with dual-wielded weapons and powerful passives like swords, flamethrowers, and character augments. Build your loadout in the lobby, teleport-dash through escalating enemies, and unlock upgrades that transform every run. Built for full-motion VR, Plasmaborne delivers heavy recoil, crisp gunfeel, and endlessly replayable combat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cybersnake-x.com/privacy-policy.html", "dev